{"id":"0ce10e13d5dbce5c","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-thm-ground-axiom-statement.md","title":"Ground Axiom Statement","display":"thm-ground-axiom-statement — Ground Axiom Statement","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-ground-axiom-statement","aliases":["58-thm-ground-axiom-statement"],"display":"thm-ground-axiom-statement — Ground Axiom Statement","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-ground-axiom-statement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-ground-axiom-statement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ground-axiom-statement — Ground Axiom Statement"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ground.md\">../batch06/58-df-ground.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V,W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(V,W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span> 为元理论类变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^2\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^2\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ground.md\">../batch06/58-df-ground.md</a>；该关系允许平凡 ground。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GA}:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{GA}:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 为同一类元语言中的定义模式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ground\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}statement}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{GA}(V)\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\land W\\subsetneq V\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ground\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}statement}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{GA}(V)\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\land W\\subsetneq V\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The upstream ground predicate deliberately permits the trivial ground <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=V\">\\(W=V\\)</span>; the strict inclusion is therefore essential to the Ground Axiom.</li>\n<li>The axiom does not say that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> has no proper inner models.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ground.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ground.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^2$ 采用 [[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]；该关系允许平凡 ground。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V,W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GA}:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ground\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}statement}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{GA}(V)\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\land W\\subsetneq V\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"W=V","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1055,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4188","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-thm-ground-axiom-statement.md|58-thm-ground-axiom-statement]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["d0244462250ae67e"]}